  perfect sense to all of you i am sure  now you might be wondering how i screwed  this up so i'll tell you the entire  story  so going back quite a few years maybe i  want to say 10  11 years ago or something like that it's  been a while now i was working for this  company  i dropped out of college and i was  working for this company and i was  working around the clock i was trying to  prove myself as a developer and the  first big project i worked on  was this massive website it was tnid.us  at the time  and basically what we did is whenever  someone googled a phone number a  us-based phone number like this this is  my cell phone number by the way  so don't like call me during the  presentation or it's going to mess stuff  up  but what would happen is whenever  someone googled it we were the first  result and so people would find our  website they'd land on our website and  then we would show them all sorts of  information  like the person's name who owns that  phone number their their  approximate address a bunch of metadata  and this was fantastic because guess  what a lot of people google phone  numbers when they miss a phone call  millions of people a day actually and so  this website was like printing money for  us at the time  and the reason is that we would make ten  dollars in an affiliate commission  every time someone would land on the  site and purchase an additional report  where they could find more information  about this phone number  so it's fantastic so as i mentioned this  was my first big job out of college i  was working crazy hours all the time  and my wife really hated that so she was  like hey look you've been working 16  hours a day for like two years  let's go on vacation so we scheduled our  very first vacation trip we went to  santa cruz in california which is sort  of where i'm from  we have this nice beach house and as  soon as i get to the beach house no  joke i get a phone call from my boss and  he said hey  uh you know we have a lit